{
  "_doc": "Quest catalog. Two tracks. `daily` is a rotating pool: quest-engine.js picks a fixed number of them per day (seeded by the date, so everyone bot-wide sees the same set and it changes at midnight). `milestone` is a one-time ordered track: each entry is claimable once ever, gated on a lifetime counter, and they surface roughly in order. Every quest has a `metric` (what event advances it) and a `goal` (how many). Rewards: type is one of solars|xp|gems|stamina|seasonPoints (a plain amount paid straight into the wallet) or item|character (granted through addOwnedSeasonContent, itemId required). Copy is player-facing: no dashes, commas and colons only.",

  "metrics": {
    "kill": "a monster killed in a dungeon (any dungeon, swarm or 1v1)",
    "floor": "a dungeon floor cleared",
    "catch": "a wild Pokemon caught",
    "pvp_win": "a player-vs-player duel won",
    "poke_win": "a Pokemon battle won",
    "level": "a character level gained"
  },

